#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:5
msgid "Edit title block"
msgstr "编辑图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech only allows editing the templates from `User collection`_ or "
"`project embedded collection`_. The `QET collection`_ title blocks cannot be"
" edited."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 只允许编辑 `用户集合 <User collection_>`_ 或 `项目内嵌集合 <project embedded "
"collection_>`_ 中的模板。`QET 集合 <QET collection_>`_ 中的图框不能编辑。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:12
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows opening the title block templates from `QET collection`_"
" with `title block editor`_. Once the template is modified, it has to be "
"saved using the option **Save as** and create a new template."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许使用 `图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_ 打开 `QET 集合 <QET "
"collection_>`_ 中的图框模板。模板一旦修改，就必须使用 **Save as** 选项保存，并创建一个新模板。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:16
msgid "Edit title block from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏编辑图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:18
msgid ""
"Select **Project > Project properties > New folio** menu item to display "
"`default folio properties`_ from `project`_."
msgstr ""
"选择 **Project > Project properties > New folio** 菜单项，以从 `项目 <project_>`_ 显示 "
"`默认图幅属性 <default folio properties_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:19
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:31
msgid ""
"Go to `title block information`_ and select the title block which should be "
"edited."
msgstr "转到 `图框信息 <title block information_>`_ 并选择要编辑的图框。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:20
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:32
msgid ""
"Select the option **Edit this template** to display `title block editor`_."
msgstr "选择选项 **Edit this template** 以显示 `图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:25
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech new folio properties PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 新建图幅属性弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:28
msgid "Edit title block from folio properties"
msgstr "从图幅属性编辑图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:30
msgid ""
"`Display folio properties`_ from one of the `folios`_ of the `project`_."
msgstr ""
"从 `项目 <project_>`_ 的某个 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 中 `显示图幅属性 <Display folio "
"properties_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:37
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech folio properties PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图幅属性弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:40
msgid "Edit title block from project panel"
msgstr "从项目面板编辑图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:42
msgid "Right click on one title block template which should be edited."
msgstr "右键单击应编辑的图框模板。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:43
msgid ""
"Click the option **Edit this template** to open the template with `title "
"block editor`_."
msgstr "单击选项 **Edit this template** ，使用 `图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_ 打开该模板。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:48
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Project panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目面板"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_edit.rst:52
msgid ""
"If the `project panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Projects**."
msgstr ""
"如果 `项目面板 <project panel_>`_ 未显示，可从 **Settings > Display > Projects** 中将其显示。"
